### 13. sm.json `{stage.X}` expansions — the two-status rules now expand (in 'none' mode) to `status in ('In Review - Passed') OR status in ('In Review - Failed')` — wait, how? The template is `({stage.IN_REVIEW_PASSED:In Review - Passed} OR {stage.IN_REVIEW_FAILED:In Review - Failed…

