The ✅ log prints even when `moveToStatusOrMark` returned `{moved:false, marked:true}` — that's arguably fine ("moved or marked"), but per ticket requirement #5: "`✅ Moved …` must only print when `result.moved || result.marked`". Here the ✅ prints whenever no throw — moved true, marked true, or... hmm, when neither works `moveToStatusOrMark` throws, so ✅ won't print. So ✅ prints iff moved||marked. OK, satisfies the requirement.

### 7. `resolveFinalStatus` in `mergeStoryTestAutomationPR.js` and `prepareTestPRForReview.js` — signature changed (from `(currentStatus, jiraConfig)` string param to `(tc, jiraConfig, tracker)` object param). These are internal module functions, not exported, presumably. The ticket said "No signature/return-shape changes of exported functions". Let me check if these are exported.

